    "text": "IT is hereby notified that the Honourable President, in terms of Section 2 of the Conferring the Honour of Senior Instructing Attorneys-at-Law Act, No. 26 of 2023 and the Guidelines on Conferring the Honour of Senior Instructing Attorneys-at-Law made by the Honourable Minister of Justice, Prison Affairs and Constitutional Reforms under Section 3 of the said Act and published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2363/73 dated December 22, 2023, has conferred the Honour of Senior Instructing Attorney-at-Law to the following Attorneys-at-Law on the 02nd day of May, 2024.",
